{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Jaeger UI",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "http://localhost:16686"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "markdown" },
        "content": "## VPP Distributed Tracing\n\n- **Jaeger UI**: [http://localhost:16686](http://localhost:16686) — search by Service / Operation / Trace ID\n- **Logs ↔ Traces**: In **VPP Logs Overview**, click **TraceID** on a log line to jump to Jaeger (derived field)\n- **Traces → Logs**: In Jaeger span details, use **Logs for this span** (Loki `tracesToLogs` link)\n\nSelect a service below to list recent traces ingested via OTLP (`tracing.endpoint: 127.0.0.1:4318`)."
      },
      "title": "How to use",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 14, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
          "limit": 30,
          "queryType": "search",
          "refId": "A",
          "service": "$service"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Recent Traces",
      "transformations": [],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 12, "lineWidth": 1 },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (service) (count_over_time({job=\"vpp\"} | json | trace_id != \"\" [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Trace-correlated Log Volume",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 12, "lineWidth": 1 },
          "unit": "reqps"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 17 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(app_requests_total{status=\"failure\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} failures/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Request Failures (correlate with traces)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=\"vpp\", service=~\"$service\"} | json | level=\"error\" | trace_id != \"\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Error Logs with Trace ID",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["vpp", "jaeger", "traces"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "gateway", "value": "gateway" },
        "label": "Service",
        "name": "service",
        "options": [
          { "selected": false, "text": "resource", "value": "resource" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "telemetry", "value": "telemetry" },
          { "selected": true, "text": "gateway", "value": "gateway" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "dispatch", "value": "dispatch" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "simulator", "value": "simulator" }
        ],
        "query": "resource,telemetry,gateway,dispatch,simulator",
        "type": "custom"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "VPP Traces Overview",
  "uid": "vpp-traces",
  "version": 1
}
